WEBVTT

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:13.040
Let's go!

00:00:13.276 --> 00:00:15.276
It's not Superman!

00:00:21.404 --> 00:00:23.224
Secret agent

00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:28.340
Subtitles by the Amara.org community

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:40.440
Faster than lightning!

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:44.080
More powerful than a tidal wave!

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:55.160
Stronger than a hurricane, this fantastic alien from the planet Krypton.

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:56.600
The Iron Man.

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:57.810
Super-Man.

00:01:00.412 --> 00:01:08.412
Owned by an incredible physical strength, the superman fights incessantly for truth and justice, disguised as a timid newspaper reporter.

00:01:09.212 --> 00:01:10.132
Of course it's hot.

00:01:21.436 --> 00:01:22.436
Pharmacia.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.330
You must do your duty. Now do what I told you to do.

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:33.510
But, boss...

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:34.770
No talking. End of story.

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:27.320
They didn't catch me in a flash.

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:29.590
I need to go to the police station right away.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:30.920
Cheers!

00:02:42.348 --> 00:02:44.348
But you terrible idiots!

00:02:44.524 --> 00:02:47.564
I told you to get that woman, but what did you do?

00:02:47.564 --> 00:02:50.724
You let her escape and brought me this idiot!

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:54.360
She can't get to the airport, she needs to be detained!

00:02:55.884 --> 00:02:56.384
Sir...

00:02:56.748 --> 00:02:59.988
They are the worst bandits that exist in this country.

00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:04.340
I know. For six months, I pretended to be one of them.

00:03:05.210 --> 00:03:07.710
This folder contains a list with their names,

00:03:07.990 --> 00:03:10.210
along with their destruction plans.

00:03:10.570 --> 00:03:14.100
They won't leave me alone until I recover the folder.

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:16.340
I need to take it to Washington.

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:20.820
I understand. It will be escorted to the airport.

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:34.720
The airport is still ahead.

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:05.020
She escaped! She's coming here! Now!

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:07.450
Control Tower

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:22.860
She's stuck in the bridge.

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:24.330
What do we do now?

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:27.640
Hello? Neres?

00:05:28.020 --> 00:05:29.160
Hello? Hello?

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:34.930
Damn it! They did everything wrong! I need to get those files!

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:15.210
The elevator is coming back!

00:06:21.220 --> 00:06:21.620
But...

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:22.120
Did you do something?

00:06:22.460 --> 00:06:23.240
I can't do anything!

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:23.720
Move!
